Subject: Preserve pointer capabilities for typed properties, WeakRefs/WeakMap, and ext/dom lexbor IDs
Policy-Class: P4-Audit
Rationale: Fil-C drops a pointer's capability across integer round-trips. Tag zend_property_info_source_list and weakref payloads via pointer arithmetic, and route WeakMap object keys, bundled lexbor dynamic tag/attr/ns/prefix IDs, and ext/dom namespace_compat node keys through weak zexact_ptrtable mappings under __FILC__.
Upstream-Status: Fil-C-Specific
Fil-C-Origin-Commits: fd1f26a649078e4e12cb01026cf43199b6e6d160
Origin-Kind: filc-upstream
Origin-Project: pizlonator/fil-c
Origin-Commit: fd1f26a649078e4e12cb01026cf43199b6e6d160
Origin-URL: https://github.com/pizlonator/fil-c/commit/fd1f26a649078e4e12cb01026cf43199b6e6d160

